('T1.2', 'coach', 'Develop a Micro-Credential for AI in the Classroom', 'Create a micro-credential that recognizes teachers who have demonstrated proficiency in the ethical and effective use of AI in the classroom. The micro-credential should include a set of competencies, a portfolio of evidence, and a process for assessment.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.2', 'higher_ed', 'Create an Open Educational Resource (OER) on AI Ethics', 'Develop an open educational resource (OER) on the topic of AI ethics for academic programs. The OER should include a variety of materials, such as readings, case studies, and lesson plans, that can be freely used and adapted by other educators.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.2', 'higher_ed', 'Organize a Conference on AI in Education', 'Plan and organize a regional conference on the topic of AI in education. The conference should bring together a diverse group of stakeholders, including K-12 educators, higher university faculty, researchers, and policymakers, to share their work and ideas.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.2', 'leader', 'Develop a District-Wide AI Implementation Plan', 'Develop a comprehensive, multi-year plan for the implementation of AI in your district. The plan should address issues such as infrastructure, professional development, curriculum, and community engagement.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.2', 'leader', 'Host a Community Forum on AI in Education', 'Plan and host a community forum on the topic of AI in education. The forum should bring together a diverse group of stakeholders, including students, parents, teachers, and community members, to discuss the potential benefits and risks of AI.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.2', 'sped', 'Partner with a Developer to Create an Accessible AI Tool', 'Imagine you have the opportunity to partner with a software developer to create a new AI-powered tool for students with disabilities. What would you create? Write a detailed project proposal that outlines the tool''s features, functionality, and potential impact.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
