('T1.2', 'support', 'Develop a Peer Mentoring Program for Digital Citizenship', 'Create a peer mentoring program that trains high school students to teach younger students about digital citizenship and the responsible use of AI. The program should include a training curriculum for the mentors and a series of lessons for the younger students.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.2', 'support', 'Create a Restorative Justice Protocol for Online Incidents', 'Develop a restorative justice protocol for responding to online incidents, such as cyberbullying or the spread of misinformation. The protocol should focus on repairing harm and promoting a positive school climate.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'classroom', 'AI Debate Lesson Plan', 'I am a [grade level] government teacher. Create a comprehensive, 3-day lesson plan where students use an AI chatbot as a debate partner to prepare for a debate on the Electoral College. The lesson must include: a prompt for students to use to prime the AI, instructions for a structured debate, and a rubric that assesses both their debate performance and their responsible use of the AI tool, including a reflection on the AI''s potential biases.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'classroom', 'Transformative AI Assessment', 'I teach [grade level] biology. I want to move beyond traditional tests. Design an assessment where students use AI to create a public service announcement (in the form of a video script and storyboard) about the importance of vaccination. The prompt should require students to use AI for research and scriptwriting, but the final project must demonstrate their own unique analysis and creative synthesis of the information, including citations for all sources, including the AI.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'coach', 'AI Coaching Cycle Plan', 'I am an instructional coach beginning a coaching cycle with a veteran teacher who is skeptical about using AI. Create a 6-week coaching plan that aims to move the teacher from skepticism to confident experimentation. The plan should include weekly goals, specific co-planning and co-teaching activities, and reflective questions to guide your conversations with the teacher.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'coach', 'AI-Powered Differentiation', 'I am coaching a [grade level] teacher on differentiation. Create a prompt for the teacher to use with an AI tool that will generate three versions of a math word problem about fractions. The prompt should specify that one version should be for students working on grade level, one for students needing extra support (with scaffolding), and one for students needing a challenge (a multi-step problem). The AI should also provide the answer key for all three versions.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'higher_ed', 'Teacher Prep Program Redesign', 'As the dean of a college of education, I want to redesign our secondary academic program to have a deep focus on AI. Outline a proposal that infuses AI across the curriculum, not just in a single ''tech'' course. The proposal should describe new learning outcomes, key changes to at least three core courses (e.g., content-area methods, assessment, adolescent literacy), and a new signature field experience where program candidates partner with a school to lead an AI-related initiative.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'higher_ed', 'Action Research on AI', 'I am a university professor mentoring a group of in-service teachers in an action research course. Provide a detailed research plan template they can use to investigate the impact of a specific AI tool on their students'' learning. The template must include sections for a research question, literature review, methodology (including data collection and analysis), and a timeline for a semester-long project.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'leader', 'AI Implementation Roadmap', 'As the superintendent of a mid-sized, diverse school district, create a 3-year strategic roadmap for the district-wide implementation of artificial intelligence. The roadmap must include phases for: 1) Policy development and community engagement, 2) Infrastructure and tool procurement, 3) Phased professional development for all staff, and 4) A system for monitoring and evaluating the impact on student outcomes and equity.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'leader', 'AI Ethics Committee Charter', 'I am a high school principal forming a new AI Ethics Committee composed of teachers, students, parents, and administrators. Draft a charter for this committee. The charter should outline the committee''s mission, responsibilities (including reviewing new tools and investigating integrity violations), membership, and meeting protocols.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'sped', 'AI for Executive Functioning', 'I am a special education teacher working with a middle school student who has ADHD and struggles with executive functioning, specifically task initiation and planning. Design a system for the student that uses an AI-powered chatbot as an executive functioning coach. Provide a series of five specific, copy-paste ready prompts the student can use at the beginning of a project to break it down into manageable steps, set deadlines, and create a checklist.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'sped', 'Bias Evaluation in AI Tools', 'I am a special education coordinator evaluating a new AI-powered reading comprehension tool for district-wide adoption. Generate a detailed rubric to assess the tool for potential bias against students with disabilities. The rubric should include criteria for evaluating the accessibility of the interface, the representation of disability in its content, and whether the algorithm fairly assesses responses from students who use assistive technologies.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'support', 'AI Professional Learning Series', 'I am a technology integration specialist tasked with designing a year-long, asynchronous professional learning series on AI for all district staff. Outline six modules (one every 6 weeks) that take staff from beginner to advanced. The modules should be practical, role-specific (with different paths for teachers, support staff, and leaders), and include a final capstone project where staff create a resource using AI for their specific role.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T1.3', 'support', 'AI Data Privacy Training', 'As the district''s data privacy officer, create a 20-minute interactive training module for all staff on data privacy and security when using generative AI. The module must cover: how student data can be compromised, how to identify compliant vs. non-compliant tools, and the district''s protocol for reporting a potential data breach related to an AI tool. Include three scenario-based quiz questions.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
