('T3.3', 'higher_ed', 'Literature review synthesis', 'I have uploaded 20 recent research articles on the use of AI in K-12 education. Synthesize these articles to produce a literature review that identifies the dominant research themes, the most significant findings, and the most pressing unanswered questions. Based on this synthesis, propose three novel dissertation topics for doctoral students studying educational technology.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T3.3', 'leader', 'Predictive resource allocation', 'Analyze our district''s last three years of team data reports, teacher retention statistics, and student achievement data (attached). Build a predictive model that identifies which schools are at highest risk of decreased student performance next quarter. Based on the model, recommend a differentiated resource allocation plan for instructional coaching and professional development funds.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T3.3', 'leader', 'Policy simulation', 'I am considering a new district policy that mandates all collaborative teams use a specific AI tool for data analysis. Based on the attached research on AI adoption and teacher workload, run a simulation of this policy''s potential impact on three different school contexts: a high-performing suburban school, a rural school with limited tech access, and an under-resourced urban school. Outline the likely benefits, challenges, and unintended consequences for each.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T3.3', 'sped', 'Cross-reference IEP & Gen Ed Data', 'Act as a special education coordinator. I have uploaded two data sets: 1) IEP progress monitoring data for all students in [grade level], and 2) the results of the [grade level] [subject area] common formative assessment for all students. Cross-reference these two sets to identify which students with IEPs are showing similar misconceptions to their general education peers and which are showing unique error patterns, suggesting a need for more specialized intervention beyond what the collaborative team is planning.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T3.3', 'sped', 'Intervention efficacy analysis', 'I have data from three different reading intervention groups that were formed based on our last team data analysis. The data shows student performance on a series of 5 probes over 3 weeks. Analyze the rate of improvement for each group to determine which intervention (''A'', ''B'', or ''C'') was most effective, and for which specific skill deficit.', 1, NOW(), NOW()),
('T3.3', 'support', 'Early warning system design', 'Act as a school data specialist. Design an early warning system by analyzing our student information system data (attendance, grades, discipline referrals) from the past two years. Identify the key combination of indicators that most accurately predicted a student falling into Tier 3 intervention needs. Create a dashboard mockup that would display this information for our support staff team.', 0, NOW(), NOW()),
('T3.3', 'support', 'Resource mapping', 'I have uploaded a list of community-based mental health and academic support resources, including their specialties and costs. I have also uploaded an anonymized list of students identified by our collaborative teams as needing external support, with notes on their specific needs. Match the students to the most appropriate resources, optimizing for need, location, and cost-effectiveness.', 1, NOW(), NOW());
